{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32551","headline":"冯叟居 · 刘驾","name":"冯叟居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天作冯叟居，山僧尚嫌僻。\n开门因两树，结宇倚翠壁。\n溪南有微径，时遇采芝客。\n往往白云生，对面千里隔。\n机忘若僮仆，常与猨鸟剧。\n晒药上小峰，庭深无日色。\n自忘归乡里，不见新旧戚。\n累累子孙墓，秋风吹古柏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}